      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I don't care if a quest user is using a very poor avatar. So to be honest it would be pretty cool if there is a way where we could allow the quest users to bypass our safety settings.   I hate having to click show avatar for every quest user so I can see but their avatar looks like",
